<title>GERMANY: Daimler - 96 results good basis for growth.</title>
<headline>Daimler - 96 results good basis for growth.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG chief financial officer Manfred Gentz said on Wednesday that its 1996 results formed a good basis for a positive trend in results in the current year and beyond.</p>
<p>Gentz made the comment in the text of a speech to be delivered at the group's annual news conference in Stuttgart. The group earlier said 1997 first quarter sales rose 12 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
